Definitions

Design Pattern  Identifies any combination of up to 60 alphanumeric
                characters indicating the design's pattern.  The
                following rules apply.

                ş    Place the pattern statement after the title and
                     before revision as shown in the syntax example.
                     The software assumes this order.

                ş    Write the pattern statement on one line.

                ş    Do not use a dollar sign,$.

                However, you can use reserved words within the pattern
                statement.
ú
Use
The PATTERN statement is optional.  If you do not include it, the
software issues a warning and continues processing the file.  If you
include multiple pattern statements, the software issues an error and
stops processing the file.
